    <string name="about">About</string>
    <string name="about_tagline">Forough — a bright window to the open internet</string>
    <string name="about_body">Forough is a fast, beautiful VPN client for the open internet — built on the Psiphon network, with a native Android interface, full Persian RTL support, a manual CDN edge scanner, a live traffic graph, a built-in speed test, and automatic tunnel restarts. Unofficial project — not affiliated with Psiphon Inc. Learn more at psiphon.ca.</string>
    <string name="about_attribution">Built on the open-source Psiphon network and the psiphon-tunnel-core engine. Psiphon is a registered trademark of Psiphon Inc. This is a community client, not the official Psiphon app.</string>
